{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/emerald-vision-tower-vision-avenue-homes-jvt-jumeirah-village-triangle","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":324,"crm_id":"2282","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"ready","title":"Emerald Vision Tower","slug":"emerald-vision-tower-vision-avenue-homes-jvt-jumeirah-village-triangle","display_address":"Jumeirah Village Triangle (JVT)","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"2024","developer":"Vision Avenue Homes","price":629000,"display_price":"629K","lattitude":25.0331595,"longitude":55.1698882,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":3,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Emerald Vision Tower is a luxury masterpiece from Vision Avenue Homes that reimagines urban life with elegance and sophistication in a prime location. The building has 5 floors, each space is designed with comfort and sophistication in mind.</p><p>With its bold, elegant design and shimmering facade, this architectural marvel stands out from the skyline. The complex offers studios, spacious <strong>1, 2 and 3 bedroom apartments.</strong> Floor-to-ceiling windows offer a panoramic view of the city landscape, allowing you to watch the heartbeat of the metropolis day and night. Whether you want a king-size bed, a cozy reading corner, or a private work space, your bedroom will suit your preferences.</p><p>The gym offers state-of-the-art fitness equipment, an inspiring atmosphere with ample natural light, and a flexible visiting schedule. The outdoor barbecue area is a great place for families to enjoy an outdoor meal. Emerald Vision Tower also offers a special wellness steam bath and sauna on the territory of the residential complex, which promotes relaxation and wellness.</p><p>The Emerald Vision Tower is approximately a 25 — minute drive from Dubai Mall, a 17 — minute drive from Palm Jumeirah Island, a 21 — minute drive from Burj Al Arab, and a 17-minute drive from The Walk JBR. Dubai International Airport (DXB) is approximately a 33 — minute drive away, while the new Al Maktoum International Airport is approximately a 24-minute drive away.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2282/images/2024/06/25/RL31PhtzqMx8OkZ1MIFStFlmbEhX8IXKliSm2PIq.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/25/RL31PhtzqMx8OkZ1MIFStFlmbEhX8IXKliSm2PIq.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2282/images/2024/06/25/jRMzhe06GUGwjzP23rj2ffZvPzGF9i0CgrUsLQT1.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/25/jRMzhe06GUGwjzP23rj2ffZvPzGF9i0CgrUsLQT1.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2282/images/2024/06/25/1e5wcqBL5CD1XwRpABtbdd4o6PDscal2DMj3PAxg.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/25/1e5wcqBL5CD1XwRpABtbdd4o6PDscal2DMj3PAxg.png","__ggfxIndex":2}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":3068,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/06/25/yEy1x1ilIFlbBr5WObvuwVhVeFEI5wBsQ2V1ZQHz.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1569,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1634,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1635,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1636,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1637,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"Studio","kitchen":null,"